# W31, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land (the gate to stag0201), waits for b and c, and after c went on to stag0202 takes
# stag0201's matz01 into dng204b1 alone (b is not on the mat: the exit port asks nobody else). b goes along and joins it;
# after c's notice ran out a takes dng204b1's matz02 to dng204b2 (b stays in B1), where c joins it by going along.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=3,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@420 fail stagechange
log b and c joined
idle until present=2 or epoch>=@600 fail stagechange
log c went on
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@800
log a in dng204b1
idle until present=2,sealed>=600 fail epoch>=@1000
log b joined a in B1
idle until frames>=2400
explore matz02 yes until stage=dng204b2,control fail epoch>=@1400
log a in dng204b2
idle until present=2,sealed>=600 fail epoch>=@1700
log c joined a in B2
idle until frames>=120
